    "body": "If the `==` operator on two `Coin` fails, the developer should also see the conditions under which it failed. All that is required is adding a `<<` operator, moving the `==` out of the namespace, and switching `==` sites to `BOOST_TEST`.\r\n\r\nThis is a pre-requiste for #35713 but seems to be a benefit on its own.",
